": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le09ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Hey! Red looks great on you. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thanks. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I was cooking when you texted me. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: A dish? What was it?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: You'll find out when I make it for you.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le09ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're going to cook for me?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: That's right. Hey, there's a teeter totter. </span></br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't like those. When I was a kid, while I was playing on one, I flew off!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Wow! What happened?", "id": 2, "time": "10750", "image": "engenn5le09ob02re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: All I remember was, as I was flying in the air, my glasses came off. Just as I was heading towards the ground, my glasses broke. And the glass cut my forehead right by this eyebrow. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: That's unbelievable! Did you get stitches?", "id": 3, "time": "25600", "image": "engenn5le09ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: 6.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Oh boy!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What about you? Any stitches?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Not yet. I just injured my knee while I was playing lacrosse.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Get outta here! You play lacrosse, you cook, you volunteer. What don't you do?", "id": 4, "time": "42000", "image": "engenn5le09ob02re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le09ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le09ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "